meta {
  name: 13-Confirm my session via /me
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/me
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{temi_token}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.role: eq APPLICANT
}

docs {
  Quick sanity-check on my login. /me should echo back my role and
  user ID. I want to confirm my role defaulted to APPLICANT (since
  I picked it) and that my JWT works.

  As a real user I wouldn't call this directly — but the frontend
  would on app boot, so this proves the contract.
}
